WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,590 --> 00:00:02,590
Come here, I'll take you to find something to eat

2
00:00:02,590 --> 00:00:09,840
are you crazy

3
00:00:09,840 --> 00:00:19,810
Break your leg and eat it

4
00:00:19,810 --> 00:00:21,810
I didn't expect that I wouldn't be able to get off.

5
00:00:21,810 --> 00:00:22,810
Resources are never lifeless medicine seeds

6
00:00:22,810 --> 00:00:23,810
Your leg is broken now

7
00:00:23,810 --> 00:00:25,810
There is no difference between being on this island and slowly waiting to die.

8
00:00:25,810 --> 00:00:28,540
thank you just now

9
00:00:28,540 --> 00:00:30,540
Thanks, I'll make up for what I missed today.

10
00:00:30,540 --> 00:00:32,920
You can't move me for 10 seconds first

11
00:00:32,920 --> 00:00:34,920
Okay, 9 seconds left

12
00:00:34,920 --> 00:00:40,750
Thank you for saving your life

13
00:00:40,750 --> 00:00:41,940
Just save it

14
00:00:41,940 --> 00:00:43,940
Is this thank you gift too cheap?

15
00:00:43,940 --> 00:00:44,940
Don't push yourself too far
